**/target
**/.gradle
**/gradle
**/build

# Rust build outputs
**/target

# C++ build outputs
**/bazel-*
**/cmake-build-*

# C++ Windows-local Bazel override (hardcoded D:\zoo\bin\protoc27.2.exe path;
# only valid on the Windows host toolchain, breaks the Linux Docker build)
hello-grpc-cpp/.bazelrc.user

# C# / .NET
**/bin
**/obj

